---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy — Ariadna Balsells" lang="en"
  description="Cookie policy for Ariadna Balsells, speech therapist in Woluwe-Saint-Lambert: which cookies are used and how to manage your preferences.">

  <section class="policy">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This page explains which cookies are used on this site and how you can manage your
        preferences at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>What is a cookie?</h2>
      <p>
        A cookie is a small file stored on your device when you visit a website. It can, for
        example, remember your preferences or measure site traffic. "Essential" cookies are
        necessary for the site to work properly; all others are only set with your consent.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies used on this site</h2>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Essential</h3>
        <p>
          A single essential cookie is used to remember your cookie choice
          (<code>cookie_consent</code>). It is kept for about 6 months and only serves to avoid
          asking you again on every visit. It does not require your consent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Audience measurement — Google Analytics</h3>
        <p>
          With your consent, Google Analytics is used to understand how visitors arrive at the
          site and which pages they view. This information is aggregated and helps improve the
          site. These cookies are only set if you accept them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cookie-cat">
        <h3>Map — Google Maps</h3>
        <p>
          The Contact page displays a map provided by Google Maps. Until you accept cookies, the
          map stays hidden and a link lets you open it directly on Google Maps. Once cookies are
          accepted, the map is shown on the page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Manage my preferences</h2>
      <p>
        You can change your choice at any time by reopening the consent window below. You can also
        delete cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>
      <button type="button" class="manage-btn" onclick="window.openCookieSettings && window.openCookieSettings()">
        Change my cookie preferences
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
  .policy { padding: 5rem 0 4rem; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .lead { color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.75; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text); }
  p { color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.75; }
  code {
    background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.1em 0.4em; font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .cookie-cat {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .manage-btn {
    margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--color-accent); color: white; border: none;
    border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
    font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .manage-btn:hover { background: var(--color-accent-dark); }
</style>
